{"description":"Look up and enrich known people or companies: profiles and work history, or firmographics such as industry, headcount, funding and technologies. Each provider block takes people, companies or both, each its own list of 1 to 50. A block with both runs them as two requests and reports two entries, kind \"people\" and kind \"companies\"; results carry input_index into their entry's list. Add contact_fields to get work email, personal email or mobile for people. Misses are free. Example: {\"contact_fields\":[\"work_email\"],\"fullenrich\":{\"people\":[{\"person_name\":\"Jane Doe\",\"company_domain\":\"example.com\"}]}}. Each provider takes its own native parameters; nothing is shared between providers. Include a block only for each provider you want to run, e.g. \"apollo\": {...}; included providers run in parallel. The response lists every provider with its status, records, credits charged and any error.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"apollo":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Apollo. people: 30 credits per match, includes a work email when Apollo has one. companies: 30 credits per match; a name alone matches only on an exact name. Runs once an organization admin has accepted Apollo's terms.","properties":{"companies":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"anyOf":[{"properties":{"domain":{"pattern":"\\S"}},"required":["domain"]},{"properties":{"linkedin_url":{"pattern":"\\S"}},"required":["linkedin_url"]},{"properties":{"name":{"pattern":"\\S"}},"required":["name"]},{"properties":{"website":{"pattern":"\\S"}},"required":["website"]}],"properties":{"domain":{"type":"string"},"linkedin_url":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"website":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"maxItems":50,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"people":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"anyOf":[{"properties":{"id":{"pattern":"\\S"}},"required":["id"]},{"properties":{"email":{"pattern